      <p begin="00:00.020" end="00:02.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Metro)</p>
      <p begin="00:02.590" end="00:05.460" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:05.460" end="00:07.820" ttm:agent="v1">Hmm</p>
      <p begin="00:07.820" end="00:11.930" ttm:agent="v1">Oh my, she's a long way from suburban towns</p>
      <p begin="00:11.930" end="00:15.850" ttm:agent="v1">Came to the city for the love, got her hurtin' now</p>
      <p begin="00:15.850" end="00:19.800" ttm:agent="v1">Oh my, she's a long way from suburban town</p>
      <p begin="00:19.800" end="00:23.810" ttm:agent="v1">Long way, really long way from suburbia</p>
