      <p begin="00:27.940" end="00:32.100" ttm:agent="v1">Drink too much, think too much, thoughts drownin' me</p>
      <p begin="00:32.100" end="00:35.840" ttm:agent="v1">I'm too high, please don't cry, stop doubtin' me</p>
      <p begin="00:35.840" end="00:39.820" ttm:agent="v1">You don't know love, you just show love, stop downin' me</p>
      <p begin="00:39.820" end="00:44.070" ttm:agent="v1">Self-love, he don't love himself, tryna love me</p>
